<msg type="info" file="Bitstream" num="191" delta="old" >The address value 0x<arg fmt="%08X" index="1">00000000</arg> chosen for the &quot;-g golden_config_addr&quot; setting is within the address range required for the Multiboot header inserted into the bitstream. The value will be reset to 0x<arg fmt="%08X" index="2">00000044</arg> to account for the Multiboot header.
</msg>

